>✓</span><span>Say the name out loud — does it sound natural and easy to call?</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">✓</span><span>Avoid names that sound like common commands or other pets&#x27; names.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">✓</span><span>Try out a few names and see which one your abyssinian cat responds to best.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">✓</span><span>Short names (1-2 syllables) tend to be easiest for animals to learn and recognize.</span></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"ad-slot my-8 mx-auto max-w-[728px] \" data-ad-position=\"faq\"><div class=\"border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center h-[90px] text-gray-400 text-sm select-none\">Ad - After FAQ (728×90)</div></div><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-6\">🔍 Explore Other <!-- -->Abyssinian Cat<!-- --> Name Categories</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all\" href=\"/male-abyssinian-names/\">♂️<!-- --> <!-- -->Abyssinian Cat<!-- --> <!-- -->Male Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all\" href=\"/female-abyssinian-names/\">♀️<!-- --> <!-- -->Abyssinian Cat<!-- --> <!-- -->Female Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all\" href=\"/cute-abyssinian-names/\">💕<!-- --> <!-- -->Abyssinian Cat<!-- --> <!-- -->Cute Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-700 border border-gr